        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adds a <code class=\"notranslate\">api.URL.pathname</code> subfeature <code class=\"notranslate\">encodes_trailing_space_in_opaque_path</code> to document a spec evolution that is now implemented in Safari TP.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2711087455\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/whatwg/url/issues/844\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/whatwg/url/pull/844/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/whatwg/url/pull/844\">whatwg/url#844</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #27856.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3416170551\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27856\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27856/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/27856\">#27856</a>.</p>",
